  "payload": {
    "rawResponseText": "For a **hotel conversion in Europe**, owners commonly consider **collection** or **soft-brand** options such as **Autograph Collection** and **Tribute Portfolio** at Marriott, **Curio Collection** and **Tapestry Collection** at Hilton, and **Vignette Collection** at IHG.[1][4][10]\n\nOther frequently considered conversion-friendly brands in Europe include **voco**, **Garner**, **Moxy**, **AC Hotels by Marriott**, **Hotel Indigo**, and **Ruby**.[1][3][4][10]\n\nIf you want the short answer by company:\n\n- **Marriott:** Autograph Collection, Tribute Portfolio, The Luxury Collection, Moxy, AC Hotels by Marriott, Four Points by Sheraton[1][10]\n- **Hilton:** Curio Collection, Tapestry Collection, Spark, Tempo[6][7]\n- **IHG:** Vignette Collection, voco, Garner, Hotel Indigo, Holiday Inn Express[3][4]\n- **Accor:** MGallery is a common collection-style option, and ibis / Tribe / Novotel are active conversion brands in Europe[1][8]\n\nAmong these, the most directly “collection/soft-brand” style options are **Autograph Collection**, **Tribute Portfolio**, **Curio Collection**, **Tapestry Collection**, and **Vignette Collection**.[4][10]",
